ubuntu-insights provides a CMake package:

    find_package(ubuntu-insights CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(my_app PRIVATE ubuntu-insights::insights)

Include the generated C API with:

    #include <insights/insights.h>

Imported executable targets:
    ubuntu-insights::ubuntu-insights
    ubuntu-insights::web-service (Linux only)
    ubuntu-insights::ingest-service (Linux only)
